# A plain static site needs no environment variables to run.
#
# PORT is provided by Dockhold at runtime — don't set it yourself; the start
# script already reads it (serve -l $PORT .).
#
# If you later add config your HTML/JS reads at build time, copy this file to
# .env and add it here. Never put secrets in a static site: anything served to
# the browser is public.
